隨時可簽約入住<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>#隨時可簽約入住&nbsp;#謝絕燒香拜拜寵物<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿<br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);\"><strong>⭐️【300億租金補貼】申請條件<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>✅年滿十八歲的中華民國國民。<br>✅申請人、申請人配偶、未成年子女需符合以下條件：<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■名下無房產。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■每人平均月所得低於50,700元。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■未接受政府其他住宅補貼。<br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);\"><strong>電話容易忙線，請見諒，歡迎加LINE洽談&nbsp;:)</strong></span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "蘆洲區永樂街38巷", "lat": "25.0885688", "lng": "121.4573844", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "長安街站", "distance": 66, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約66公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "永樂街站", "distance": 123, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約123公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "永樂街38巷[新巴士]站", "distance": 134, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約134公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "I KISS Hair Salon", "distance": 1225, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1225公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "生炒牛羊肉", "distance": 15, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約15公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市蘆洲區成功國民小學", "distance": 323, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約323公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "蘆洲三民國中捷運站", "distance": 690, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約690公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "11,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "電費", "value": "一度電$6", "key": "electricFee"}, {"name": "服務費", "value": "半個月租金", "key": "serviceFee"}, {"name": "管理費", "valu